  "details": "## Description\n\nMost friends are to be said Offline in their status, or in the \"invite-refuse\" dialogue. However, this is not true in many cases, and prevents invites being sent out to those that *are* online. (Not sure if reported, many apologizes.)\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nCannot be reproduced on demand. Happens often in seemingly long sessions. \n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1878-c608353bf2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR",
